{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01066","headline":"相和歌辞 挽歌 · 白居易","name":"相和歌辞 挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"丹旐何飞扬，素骖亦悲鸣。\n晨光照闾巷，輀车俨欲行。\n萧条九月天，哀挽出重城。\n借问送者谁，妻子与弟兄。\n苍苍上古原，峨峨开新茔。\n含酸一恸哭，异口同哀声。\n旧垄转芜绝，新坟日罗列。\n春风草绿北邙山，此地年年生死别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01066.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01066","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}